    <string name="emf_map_info_cd">How to enable it and what the map does</string>
    <string name="emf_map_info_title">EMF hotspots map</string>
    <string name="emf_map_info_msg">How to enable\n• Requires investigation mode unlocked and location permission with GPS on.\n• Tap RECORD to start: the app logs your position on the map together with the magnetometer reading (mG). Tap STOP to finish.\n\nFeatures\n• Each point records a hotspot: its position on the map and the field strength there.\n• The status line shows what is missing to record (permission, GPS, fix or sensor).\n• Stats on top: number of points and the highest reading.\n• CLEAR wipes all saved hotspots.\n• Needs a magnetometer; devices without the sensor cannot use this map.</string>
    <string name="emf_map_locked">Enable investigation mode (7 taps on status) to use the hotspots map.</string>
    <string name="emf_map_denied">Location denied — hotspots map unavailable.</string>
    <string name="battery_not_exempt">Battery optimized: scanning and the EMF map stop working. Set the energy restriction to None.</string>
    <string name="emf_map_gps_off">Location disabled. Turn on GPS/network to record hotspots.</string>
    <string name="emf_map_no_sensor">No sensor reading: no hotspot is being recorded. Check whether the battery is optimized or the device has no magnetometer.</string>
    <string name="emf_map_save_failed">Failed to save hotspots. The track stopped being saved — storage may be full.</string>
