    <string name="emf_corr_info_cd">How the correlation works</string>
    <string name="emf_corr_info_title">How the correlation works</string>
    <string name="emf_corr_info_msg">The window shows the last 5 seconds.\n\n• Green line: the magnetic field (magnetometer) in mG.\n• Red circle: a field peak — every rise above 15 mG becomes a peak at its highest value.\n• Blue line: a radio capture.\n• Orange band: combined event — a radio capture happening within 5 s of a field peak.\n\nThe counter below shows how many combined events have occurred. Everything resets when you close and reopen this panel.</string>
